      <slug></slug>
      <title>Choosing Hardware for MySQL</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>MySQL and Friends Devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In this session you&amp;#39;ll learn how to choose hardware that helps MySQL execute queries the most quickly, while providing the best price-to-performance ratio. This includes choosing and configuring CPUs, RAM, network, and storage systems. We&amp;#39;ll also discuss what performance you can expect from various Amazon EC2 instance sizes, including EBS volumes and Amazon&amp;#39;s RDS service for MySQL.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
      <description></description>
